  "body": "Highly motivated vendor with a genuine reason to sell.\r\n\r\nThis sprawling contemporary home enjoys the everchanging activity and spectacular harbour and city views from its privileged position on the cliff in sought-after Stanley Point.\r\n\r\nArchitect Marshall Cook cleverly captured the views, light and sun with open, contemporary living rooms accented with heart timber floors to add warmth and character. Across the front, the expansive, open living is connected to the kitchen and dining, boasting superb harbour views and city lights it opens directly onto the large ground-level deck spanning the width of the site across the water frontage. \r\n\r\nDesigned with an emphasis on ease of lifestyle inside and out, there is a harmonious balance of formal and family living with two spacious and separate living options, both with excellent flow to the outdoors, good separation between the master and children’s wings making it the perfect choice for professionals or those with older children. \r\n\r\nYou will love the appeal of the generous internal spaces with high stud and exceptional light, the long low profile providing shelter year-round and the beautifully landscaped exterior which provides an attractive easy-care setting and uninterrupted views. \r\n\r\nStanley Point in Devonport is a close commute by ferry or car to Auckland’s CBD, it is renowned for its safe quiet setting, gracious homes on large sites, ample recreational choices and proximity to excellent schools.\r\n\r\nTriple garaging plus generous off-street parking.",
